0 FILE garage-part-test.ldr
0 Isolated test of official Garage 4x8x3 (721) and its door leaf (722) to determine real orientation/origin before use
0 Name: garage-part-test.ldr
0 Author: carlos.antelo@gmail.com
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
